0..56 Comment "//! This source shows the phase distinction in a module."
57..60 Comment "//!"
61..119 Comment "//! Type members are static and value members are dynamic."
120..180 Comment "//! A member can read only members at its phase or below it."
181..184 Comment "//!"
185..249 Comment "//! The checker rejects a type member that reads a module value."
250..315 Comment "//! The lowering keeps static and dynamic members in phase order."
316..319 Comment "//!"
320..363 Comment "//! - see: pathological/modules/phase.gandr"
